<p>
  <h4>Credentials of the Investigators</h4>
</p>



</div></div></div><div><div data-block-type="2" id="block-7bf5e71427a227e9bd12"><div>

<div>
  <p>Investigators included eminent professors of pathology and scientists in accredited laboratories across the world. Most did not know where the samples had come from before reporting their results.</p><p>Examples:</p>
