      <div data-fluid-engine="true"><div><div><div data-block-type="2" id="block-c4326f246691ee713d12"><div>

<div>
  <p>All 5 investigations identified heart tissue under the microscope with visible muscle fibers.&nbsp;</p><p>2 investigations characterized the samples as type AB, a rare blood type present in 7% of humans.</p><p><strong>Signs ruling out human interference:</strong></p>
</div>



</div></div></div><div><div data-block-type="5" id="block-0dced7898a80b2ebfd20"><div>













































    <div data-test="image-block-fluid-outer-wrapper">
      <div data-animation-role="image">
        <div>







              <div>








              <p><img data-stretch="false" data-src="https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/648889cc7c5207184e04abec/ae393e12-9996-4de9-aa2d-5cfc45edb3c5/Screenshot+2023-07-28+at+6.50.45+AM.png" data-image="https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/648889cc7c5207184e04abec/ae393e12-9996-4de9-aa2d-5cfc45edb3c5/Screenshot+2023-07-28+at+6.50.45+AM.png" data-image-dimensions="190x176" data-image-focal-point="0.5,0.5" alt="" data-load="false" src="https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/648889cc7c5207184e04abec/ae393e12-9996-4de9-aa2d-5cfc45edb3c5/Screenshot+2023-07-28+at+6.50.45+AM.png" width="190" height="176" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 8.333333333333332vw" srcset="https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/648889cc7c5207184e04abec/ae393e12-9996-4de9-aa2d-5cfc45edb3c5/Screenshot+2023-07-28+at+6.50.45+AM.png?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/648889cc7c5207184e04abec/ae393e12-9996-4de9-aa2d-5cfc45edb3c5/Screenshot+2023-07-28+at+6.50.45+AM.png?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/648889cc7c5207184e04abec/ae393e12-9996-4de9-aa2d-5cfc45edb3c5/Screenshot+2023-07-28+at+6.50.45+AM.png?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/648889cc7c5207184e04abec/ae393e12-9996-4de9-aa2d-5cfc45edb3c5/Screenshot+2023-07-28+at+6.50.45+AM.png?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/648889cc7c5207184e04abec/ae393e12-9996-4de9-aa2d-5cfc45edb3c5/Screenshot+2023-07-28+at+6.50.45+AM.png?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/648889cc7c5207184e04abec/ae393e12-9996-4de9-aa2d-5cfc45edb3c5/Screenshot+2023-07-28+at+6.50.45+AM.png?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/648889cc7c5207184e04abec/ae393e12-9996-4de9-aa2d-5cfc45edb3c5/Screenshot+2023-07-28+at+6.50.45+AM.png?format=2500w 2500w" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-loader="sqs"></p>

              </div>



        </div>
      </div>
    </div>







</div></div></div><div><div data-block-type="2" id="block-4d6b5fbe095919877d7e"><div>

<p>In Sokolka, the host was inextricably linked with the flesh. Professor Maria Sobaniec-Łotowska: “<em>This remarkable phenomenon of the intermingling of the Communion and the fibers of the heart muscle observed in both light microscopes and transmission electron microscopy also demonstrates to me that there could be no human interference here.</em>”</p>



</div></div></div><div><div data-block-type="5" id="block-6c8b23d57886685875e8"><div>













































    <div data-test="image-block-fluid-outer-wrapper">
      <div data-animation-role="image">
        <div>







              <div>








              <p><img data-stretch="false" data-src="https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/648889cc7c5207184e04abec/596dfa74-7f0b-40c2-959d-f9d58f16a14b/Screenshot+2023-07-28+at+6.51.02+AM.png" data-image="https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/648889cc7c5207184e04abec/596dfa74-7f0b-40c2-959d-f9d58f16a14b/Screenshot+2023-07-28+at+6.51.02+AM.png" data-image-dimensions="202x179" data-image-focal-point="0.5,0.5" alt="" data-load="false" src="https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/648889cc7c5207184e04abec/596dfa74-7f0b-40c2-959d-f9d58f16a14b/Screenshot+2023-07-28+at+6.51.02+AM.png" width="202" height="179" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 8.333333333333332vw" srcset="https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/648889cc7c5207184e04abec/596dfa74-7f0b-40c2-959d-f9d58f16a14b/Screenshot+2023-07-28+at+6.51.02+AM.png?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/648889cc7c5207184e04abec/596dfa74-7f0b-40c2-959d-f9d58f16a14b/Screenshot+2023-07-28+at+6.51.02+AM.png?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/648889cc7c5207184e04abec/596dfa74-7f0b-40c2-959d-f9d58f16a14b/Screenshot+2023-07-28+at+6.51.02+AM.png?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/648889cc7c5207184e04abec/596dfa74-7f0b-40c2-959d-f9d58f16a14b/Screenshot+2023-07-28+at+6.51.02+AM.png?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/648889cc7c5207184e04abec/596dfa74-7f0b-40c2-959d-f9d58f16a14b/Screenshot+2023-07-28+at+6.51.02+AM.png?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/648889cc7c5207184e04abec/596dfa74-7f0b-40c2-959d-f9d58f16a14b/Screenshot+2023-07-28+at+6.51.02+AM.png?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/648889cc7c5207184e04abec/596dfa74-7f0b-40c2-959d-f9d58f16a14b/Screenshot+2023-07-28+at+6.51.02+AM.png?format=2500w 2500w" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-loader="sqs"></p>

              </div>



        </div>
      </div>
    </div>







</div></div></div><div><div data-block-type="2" id="block-00245996f161815ed85d"><div>

<p>In Tixtla, blood was found to have flowed out from inside the host, ruling out the possibility that someone planted the blood on the host. Professor Eduardo Sánchez Lazo: “<em>The possibility that the bleeding comes from the outside inwards is ruled out.</em>”</p>



</div></div></div><div><div data-block-type="5" id="block-cbe168c570dea53cdba0"><div>













































    <div data-test="image-block-fluid-outer-wrapper">
      <div data-animation-role="image">
        <div>







              <div>








              <p><img data-stretch="false" data-src="https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/648889cc7c5207184e04abec/b1c8818a-a8e4-4ad4-9447-bd4766727472/Screenshot+2023-07-28+at+6.51.54+AM.png" data-image="https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/648889cc7c5207184e04abec/b1c8818a-a8e4-4ad4-9447-bd4766727472/Screenshot+2023-07-28+at+6.51.54+AM.png" data-image-dimensions="197x180" data-image-focal-point="0.5,0.5" alt="" data-load="false" src="https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/648889cc7c5207184e04abec/b1c8818a-a8e4-4ad4-9447-bd4766727472/Screenshot+2023-07-28+at+6.51.54+AM.png" width="197" height="180" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 75vw, 8.333333333333332vw" srcset="https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/648889cc7c5207184e04abec/b1c8818a-a8e4-4ad4-9447-bd4766727472/Screenshot+2023-07-28+at+6.51.54+AM.png?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/648889cc7c5207184e04abec/b1c8818a-a8e4-4ad4-9447-bd4766727472/Screenshot+2023-07-28+at+6.51.54+AM.png?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/648889cc7c5207184e04abec/b1c8818a-a8e4-4ad4-9447-bd4766727472/Screenshot+2023-07-28+at+6.51.54+AM.png?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/648889cc7c5207184e04abec/b1c8818a-a8e4-4ad4-9447-bd4766727472/Screenshot+2023-07-28+at+6.51.54+AM.png?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/648889cc7c5207184e04abec/b1c8818a-a8e4-4ad4-9447-bd4766727472/Screenshot+2023-07-28+at+6.51.54+AM.png?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/648889cc7c5207184e04abec/b1c8818a-a8e4-4ad4-9447-bd4766727472/Screenshot+2023-07-28+at+6.51.54+AM.png?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/648889cc7c5207184e04abec/b1c8818a-a8e4-4ad4-9447-bd4766727472/Screenshot+2023-07-28+at+6.51.54+AM.png?format=2500w 2500w" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-loader="sqs"></p>

              </div>



        </div>
      </div>
    </div>







</div></div></div><div><div data-block-type="2" id="block-49bd109bbeadf54a1ab9"><div>

<p>In Lanciano, no preservatives were found, although the tissues were kept intact for centuries. Dr. Odoardo Linoli: “<em>It should also be noted that no histological section showed elements indicative of an impregnation of the tissue by mummifying substances, such as those used in ancient times for the preservation of tissues</em>.”</p>



</div></div></div></div></div>
    </div>

  </div>

</section>









