</div></div></div><div><div data-block-type="2" id="block-1d4b35d6c25b4f1427d8"><div>

<p>The tissue was removed from the water and placed on a cloth for later analysis.</p>



</div></div></div><div><div data-aspect-ratio="69.01806822608627" data-block-type="5" id="block-86bacc8ef0b6285d3604"><div>













































