      <div data-fluid-engine="true"><div><div><div data-block-type="2" id="block-yui_3_17_2_1_1688473488503_67972"><div>

<div>
  <h3>Tixtla, Mexico (2006)</h3><p>Poland is not the only country that has witnessed Eucharistic miracles. Let’s look at another transformation that took place across the Atlantic Ocean in Tixtla, Mexico. In 2006, Father Leopoldo Roque, pastor of the&nbsp;<a href="http://parroquiasmt.com.ar/" target="_blank">Parish of Saint Martin of Tours</a>, invited Father Raymundo Reyna Esteban to lead a spiritual retreat for his parishioners. Father Raymundo, known affectionately as “Father Rayito,” was a popular preacher in his fifties who managed (and still manages as of this publication) a radio and TV channel called Monte María Radio y Televisión.</p><p>People from all over came to hear their dear Father Rayito speak. The 600 retreat attendants filed into the spacious municipal auditorium to celebrate the Sunday Mass on October 22, 2006. During the Communion distribution, Sister Arely Marroquín noticed one of the hosts exuding a reddish substance that looked like fresh blood. The Eucharistic host was reserved for later study.</p>
</div>



</div></div></div><div><div data-aspect-ratio="57.59953819120259" data-block-type="5" id="block-yui_3_17_2_1_1688473488503_68938"><div>













































    <div data-test="image-block-fluid-outer-wrapper">
      <div data-animation-role="image">
        <div>







              <div>








              <p><img data-stretch="true" data-src="https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/648889cc7c5207184e04abec/a57f6e55-8dfd-42e7-a07d-924b423888ae/media+%289%29.png" data-image="https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/648889cc7c5207184e04abec/a57f6e55-8dfd-42e7-a07d-924b423888ae/media+%289%29.png" data-image-dimensions="800x600" data-image-focal-point="0.5,0.5" alt="The bleeding host of Tixtla shortly after the event on October 22, 2006" data-load="false" src="https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/648889cc7c5207184e04abec/a57f6e55-8dfd-42e7-a07d-924b423888ae/media+%289%29.png" width="800" height="600" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/648889cc7c5207184e04abec/a57f6e55-8dfd-42e7-a07d-924b423888ae/media+%289%29.png?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/648889cc7c5207184e04abec/a57f6e55-8dfd-42e7-a07d-924b423888ae/media+%289%29.png?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/648889cc7c5207184e04abec/a57f6e55-8dfd-42e7-a07d-924b423888ae/media+%289%29.png?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/648889cc7c5207184e04abec/a57f6e55-8dfd-42e7-a07d-924b423888ae/media+%289%29.png?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/648889cc7c5207184e04abec/a57f6e55-8dfd-42e7-a07d-924b423888ae/media+%289%29.png?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/648889cc7c5207184e04abec/a57f6e55-8dfd-42e7-a07d-924b423888ae/media+%289%29.png?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/648889cc7c5207184e04abec/a57f6e55-8dfd-42e7-a07d-924b423888ae/media+%289%29.png?format=2500w 2500w" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-loader="sqs"></p>

